PART1:
Technical replicates (n=2) for overall metaproteome datasets generated throughout the three phases of the project:

----Phase FA00, only acetate supplied as substrate
Data files: FA00_01.txt, FA00_02.txt

----Phase FA01, Transient phase, Formate was supplied as co-substrate in a molar ratio of Formate : Acetate = 0.1 : 1 (mol:mol)
Data files: FA01_01.txt, FA01_02.txt

----Phase FA02, Formate was supplied as co-substrate in a molar ratio of Formate : Acetate = 0.2 : 1 (mol:mol)
Data files: FA02_01.txt, FA02_02.txt

PART2:
Technical replicates (n=2) for specific PAO & GAO populations when they were dominant in the consortium

----The expression activity of genes in terms of "peptide spectra number" in Ca. Contendibacter enriched in this study, when it was dominant in the system during phase FA00
Data location: in the foler <Contendibacter_proteome>

----The expression activity of genes in terms of "peptide spectra number" in Ca. Dechloromonas enriched in this study, when it was dominant in the system during phase FA01
Data location: in the foler <Dechloromonas_proteome>

----The expression activity of genes in terms of "peptide spectra number" in Competibacter MAG1 enriched in this study, when it was dominant in the system during phase FA02
Data location: in the foler <Competibacter MAG1_proteome>
